# Old دیدار / آرپا export folders. Nothing reads them any more — exports are
# uploaded on the site («ورود از آرپا / دیدار») — but copies may still sit on
# the server, and they carry real customers' names, phones, national ids and
# amounts. Git history is permanent, so they must never be committed.
backend/data/didar/
backend/data/arpa/

# graft's local graph cache — regenerable, not committed (run `graft build`).
graft/
